OL,3,GNEWSAJason Arday research cleared      
OL,4,Afollowing Queen's University           
OL,5,Ainvestigation                          
OL,7,FIn a statement, a spokesperson for QUB 
OL,8,Fsaid: "Having reviewed the matter, we  
OL,9,Fare satisfied that the paper meets the 
OL,10,Fappropriate academic standards and have
OL,11,Fno concerns regarding its publication."
